Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `bucket.values` cannot be changed by `.push()` while `window` is still looking into it
  --> tests/ui/ownership/field_view_blocks_owner_resize.jet:9:12
    |
  9 |     bucket.values.push(4)
    |            ^^^^^^
 Why: `window` is a live read view into `bucket.values[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `window` before changing `bucket.values`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
